msgstr[0] ""
"上方每张卡片汇总的是 LAPI 仍保留的 {retained} 条告警，而不是本主机遇到过的所"
"有攻击。此处最早的告警是保留期限的边界，而非活动的开始，且 CrowdSec 不会报告"
"清理了多少条。订阅的黑名单条目被有意排除，因为它们描述的是整个互联网，而非您"
"的主机。"

#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Every card is scoped to provider {sdScope}. Click to clear."
msgstr "所有卡片已限定为提供者 {sdScope}。点击清除。"

#. Used in the browser
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Every duration in this window belongs to a connection Traefik held open "
"rather than to a response it completed, so there is nothing to average. {tip}"
msgstr ""
"此窗口中的每个时长都属于 Traefik 保持打开的连接，而非已完成的响应，因此无法计"
"算平均值。{tip}"

msgid ""
"Every enabled HTTP route on the Host and on each agent is requested from the "
"server on this schedule. Where the service has a Traefik health check that "
"result is used instead. A route counts as down after two failed checks in a "
"row, and an alert goes to the channels below under the Traefik category, "
"once when it goes down and once when it is back."
msgstr ""
"服务器会按此计划请求主机和每个 Agent 上所有已启用的 HTTP 路由。如果该服务配置"
"了 Traefik 健康检查，则改用其结果。路由连续两次检查失败后视为不可用，并会以 "
"Traefik 类别向下方渠道发送告警：不可用时发送一次，恢复时再发送一次。"

msgid ""
"Every enabled channel gets its own copy of an event, filtered by the "
"categories, severity, digest and quiet hours set on it."
msgstr ""
"每个已启用的渠道都会收到事件的独立副本，并按其设置的类别、严重级别、摘要汇总"
"和免打扰时段进行过滤。"

#. Used in the browser
msgid "Every file provider route is managed here"
msgstr "所有文件提供者路由都在此管理"

#. Used in the browser
msgid ""
"Every filter on the window row is applied together. Drop one and the rest "
