msgid ""
"Every save writes a timestamped copy of the config first, kept locally. Git "
"backup adds an off-box copy with history, diffs and restore from any commit. "
"Restoring overwrites your live config, so it takes a typed confirmation."
msgstr ""
"每次保存都会先在本地写入一份带时间戳的配置副本。Git 备份额外提供一份异机副"
"本，包含历史记录、差异对比，并可从任意提交恢复。恢复会覆盖当前生效的配置，因"
"此需要输入确认。"

